<title>POLAND: FORECAST-Polish 3-month WIBOR seen at 19.63 end-97.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Polish 3-month WIBOR seen at 19.63 end-97.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw Interbank Offered Rate (WIBOR) for three-month deposits is expected to ease to 19.63 percent by the end of the year from 22.67 percent on Tuesday, a Reuter poll of Poland's 23 biggest banks showed.</p>
<p>		  JUNE	   END-97	  12-MONTHS AHEAD</p>
<p> WIBOR AVG    22.52	19.63 (19.51)     18.32 (18.51)</p>
<p>   MINIMUM    21.80	17.00 (17.2)	15.40 (16.2)</p>
<p>   MAXIMUM    22.85	21.95 (22.7)	21.00 (23.0)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets previous figures for end-97 and May-98 from last month's poll.   -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
